Documentation: Foundation values are raw; semantic values express purpose; component values express local usage.
Rationale: Layering supports consistency and controlled reuse.
Quality gates: every reference resolves; component definitions use semantic tokens; names use lowercase dot notation; contrast remains reviewable.
Repository intent: /projects/project-001/sections/f/token-map.mmd is authoritative.
Writing rule: describe purpose and usage, not implementation detail.
Publishing rule: publish only validated names with project id and date metadata.